  m_Name: 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: ...Ah, there you are.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9edf989a1ba229f40a59b04fa3dd2d8d, type: 2}
  - text: Fret not, you will be returned to your world shortly.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9edf989a1ba229f40a59b04fa3dd2d8d, type: 2}
  - text: I just need a few things from you first...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9edf989a1ba229f40a59b04fa3dd2d8d, type: 2}
  - text: 'Please select your Pronouns:'
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9edf989a1ba229f40a59b04fa3dd2d8d, type: 2}
  - text: 'Please state your Name:'
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9edf989a1ba229f40a59b04fa3dd2d8d, type: 2}
  - text: And finally, can you confirm that you wish to give up your place in the
      Afterlife for a... "Demon Maid Cafe"?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9edf989a1ba229f40a59b04fa3dd2d8d, type: 2}
  - text: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9edf989a1ba229f40a59b04fa3dd2d8d, type: 2}
  - text: Very well.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9edf989a1ba229f40a59b04fa3dd2d8d, type: 2}
  - text: Commencing Rebirth. May God have mercy on your soul...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9edf989a1ba229f40a59b04fa3dd2d8d, type: 2}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a0f69e476ffc83b4bad2c256dc5bd974, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 72ef421c2f88eaa469ae705d952307fa, type: 2}
